        {
          "title": "在 Docker 沙箱中运行 MCP Server",
          "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202504/bg2025042402.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>本地运行他人的 MCP 服务器有极大的风险，本文介绍怎么在 Docker 沙箱里面运行。（<a href=\"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/6727\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ccbikai</a> 投稿）</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "在 Docker 沙箱中运行 MCP Server",
              "url": "https://miantiao.me/posts/guide-to-running-mcp-server-in-a-sandbox/"
            },
            {
              "text": "@ccbikai",
              "url": "https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/6727"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
