    {
      "id": "日本木匠大会",
      "title": "日本木匠大会",
      "items": [
        {
          "content": "<p>日本每年举行一次全国<a href=\"https://www.bigsandwoodworking.com/kezurou-kai-39/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">木匠大会</a>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202504/bg2025042111.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>大会有一个项目，就是刨花比赛，看看谁的刨花最薄。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202504/bg2025042112.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>比赛规定，木材必须是宽55毫米、长1800毫米的桧木。进入决赛的5名选手，为了公平，将使用同一块桧木。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202504/bg2025042120.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202504/bg2025042121.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>刨出来的刨花必须完整，没有裂口，长度在1米左右，才能参加评分。</p>\n<p>工作人员把所有选手的刨花，挂在黑板上，进行公示，评委进行打分。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202504/bg2025042114.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这些的刨花如此之薄，令人不敢相信。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202504/bg2025042115.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>冠军选手的成绩是50微米，也就是1毫米的20分之一。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202504/bg2025042410.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "木匠大会",
              "url": "https://www.bigsandwoodworking.com/kezurou-kai-39/"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202504/bg2025042111.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202504/bg2025042112.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202504/bg2025042120.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202504/bg2025042121.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202504/bg2025042114.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202504/bg2025042115.webp",
